# Changelog

## v1.3.0 — 2026-09-20
- *args / **kwargs support
- match/case pattern matching
- Walrus operator :=
- 14 extended stdlib modules
- Native Go FFI registry
- VS Code extension
- Cross-platform installer
- 62 tests passing

## v1.2.0
- User module imports (.aeth files)
- Circular import detection
- stdlib caching

## v1.1.0
- Goroutine error tracking (WaitGroup)
- globals race fix

## v1.0.0
- Initial release